{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Deploy UK forces to Sudan to help end the crisis",
        "additional_details": "People in Sudan are enduring unimaginable trauma, with reports showing atrocities against innocent people, including children, who are being subjected to rape, torture, and murder. We believe the UK has the capability to help. Peace talks alone have not worked quickly enough to save lives. We call on the UK Government to deploy British Army personnel for a peacekeeping mission to protect civilians and help bring peace to Sudan.",
        "background": "Innocent people in Sudan are being tortured, murdered, & forced from their homes. Peace talks have failed to stop atrocities. We call on the UK Government to deploy British Armed Forces to Sudan on a peacekeeping mission to protect civilians, save lives, & help restore peace and stability.",
